/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206204833","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109745#issuecomment-3206204833","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109745","id":3206204833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6_Gs2h","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-20T12:49:35Z","updated_at":"2025-08-20T13:10:28Z","body":"Ok, the issue is two-fold:\n- `EditorInterface.edit_node(EditorInterface.get_edited_scene_root())` will cause immediate inspector update, freeing the checkbox you just pressed. It triggers this error:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/28bd72a7e1146a2de40991033c148f595144079e/core/object/object.cpp#L2282-L2285\nNot sure if it can be prevented properly, just don't edit objects inside setters xd\n- `queue_free()` removes the node from selection and SceneTreeDock expects selected nodes to still exist when deselected. This is an easy fix.\n\nEDIT:\nThe first one is not a regression.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3206204833/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]